    <!--
      §1.133 — the terminal session overview action.

      A 2x2 grid of equal panes (Material Symbols "grid-view"), the same visual
      idea as the tab-overview icon in a mobile browser, which is what
      TerminalSessionOverview is. Kept as a local vector rather than
      `Icons.Outlined.Apps` because the shared app bar's TopBarAction takes a
      @DrawableRes (every other action in the bar is one of the ic_custom_*
